  "tibetan_transliteration": "\u0f58\u0f51\u0f7c\u0f62\u0f0b\u0f56\u0f66\u0fa1\u0f74\u0f66\u0f0b\u0f50\u0f63\u0f0b\u0f60\u0f42\u0fb1\u0f74\u0f62\u0f0b\u0f55\u0fb2\u0f7a\u0f44\u0f0b\u0f56",
  "comments": "Commentary on the Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya (ID:3774) addressing about fourteen points (with mention of words from the corresponding passage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47avini\u015bcaya) in the form of chains of arguments by consequence, with abundant use of the pronoun \u201ckhyod.\u201d \r\n\r\n[8H6M69W4] does not mention an author for instance (ID:4778), but the previous two works, which have the same folio size and script, as well as the same double numbering of the folios, are by Zwha lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel (ID:4129). The authorship is likely the same for this work, which adopts a similar style of presentation as other works by Zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams, several of which have the expression \"phreng\" in their title.\r\n\r\nThis work could correspond to the items No. 11847-11848 listed by A khu shes rab rgya mtsho in the Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 675, No. 11847: zhwa lu rin chen bsod nams 'phel gyi rnam nges sbyor Tik gzhan phan nor phreng le'u gnyis pa yan, and No. 11848: gzhan don le'u'i rnam bzhag). \r\nIt could also correspond to No. 11849: tshad ma'i thal phreng mdor bsdus (or this item could correspond to (ID:5306)).\r\n\r\nThe work is mistakenly ascribed to bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) in the [UJDXNMGD] due to a fragment of the latter's epistemological commentary (see work (ID:6010)) being copied at the end of the work in instance (ID:4778).",
